      "en": "Companies have **leveling** (a ladder of levels): mid → **senior engineer** (delivers projects independently and lifts the team) → **staff engineer** (influence across many teams and technical direction) → principal. A **tech lead** = a role leading a technical team (not always a level). The interview assesses scope and impact, not just knowledge."
